  <name>Corvus</name>
  <summary>Desktop client for Signal with an encrypted local chat history</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.ada_h00k">
    <name>ada-h00k</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Corvus is a native Qt 6 desktop client for Signal. Link it to your Signal account as an additional device and chat from your desktop.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read and send messages, including group chats, replies and reactions</li>
      <li>Send and receive files, images, video and audio</li>
      <li>Edit or delete messages, manage archived chats and disappearing messages</li>
      <li>Desktop notifications, notification sounds and a tray icon</li>
      <li>Encrypted local chat history, protected by the system keyring or a passphrase</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Corvus is an unofficial client and is not affiliated with Signal.</p>
    <p>This community package installs the unmodified official Linux build from Corvus's GitHub releases at install time. It includes corvus-cli, the Signal backend, and qrencode for the device-linking QR code, so nothing else needs to be installed.</p>
  </description>
